{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269Xoy9bzPzV1794989404.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平在深圳會見韓國總統李在明。</p><p></p><p>習近平表示，明年是中韓建交35周年，中方願同韓方一道，持續促進兩國人員往來，循序漸進開展健康有益的文化交流。雙方亦要堅持戰略自主，維護好兩國關係政治基礎，要進一步加強多邊協作，維護全球產業鏈供應鏈穩定暢通。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.APEC.LEADERS-1600_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NhUPC7sM141794989415.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>李在明重申，韓方堅持一個中國的政策，韓中戰略合作夥伴關係，若要更成熟發展，就必須以朝鮮半島的和平及穩定為基礎。他又希望持續推動熊貓外交等，進一步促進兩國交流的活動。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:44:50.844693+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T07:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:37:13.668410+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T08:37:59.638056+00:00","content_hash":"9516f69a18ea98efc4eab9301b0a126522f817df09ced133456f84c90301be1f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:44:50.844693+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}